+# Enumerating number WORDS is sound where enumerating the qualifier adjectives below is not: that set
+# is open, this one is closed. It has to actually be closed. A gap in it is a hole with no symptom: cut
+# the list off at fifty and `Seventy findings`, `eighty findings`, `ninety findings` and `A thousand
+# findings` all walk past, while `Ninety-five findings` still matches, by accident, on its trailing
+# `five`. So: one..nineteen, every ten from twenty to ninety, the magnitudes, and `dozen`. A compound
+# larger than these is caught on its last word — `a hundred and seventeen findings` matches at
+# `seventeen findings`.
+# Split in two, because the two arms below need different halves. RULENUM is the numbers this skill
+# states its own RULE values with — `Standard: one reviewer`, `Deep: two`, `Three fix rounds per
+# phase`, `the blocking count is zero`. In front of `percent` they are figures like any other and are
+# swept. In front of `findings` they are the skill's own prose; see the findings arm below.
