+sweep_case admits  '**Standard: one reviewer. Deep: two reviewers union findings.**'
+sweep_case admits  'If one of the findings is a phantom, triage catches it'
+sweep_case admits  'One reviewer, two findings, one round'
+sweep_case admits  'one review, one set of findings'
+sweep_case admits  'three fix rounds, three findings, one phase'
